<title>DUBAI: UAE leader to return home this week after surgery.</title>
<headline>UAE leader to return home this week after surgery.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Arab Emirates President Sheikh Zaid bin Sultan al-Nahayan will return home on Wednesday after successful surgery in the United States, the official news agency WAM said on Monday.</p>
<p>The 78-year-old leader had surgery on a vertebra in his neck at the Mayo Clinic in Minnesota on September 27.</p>
<p>After the operation he flew to Spain for a private visit and is now in Morocco.</p>
</text>
